    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Chapter 5 · Session 16</span>\n<h2>Session 16 — 4.2 Rational Decision Making</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14193 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Chương 5 · Buổi 16</span>\n<h2>Buổi 16 — 4.2 Rational Decision Making</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14193 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>4.2 Rational Decision Making<br>(Do not need to cover Evidence-based management)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>6.1</strong> — Assuming you are in the role of planning manager of ABC company in the metal manufacturing industry in Thai Nguyen Province. With the recent construction of a brand-new shopping mall in District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, your company has decided to open an entertainment park there. The problem confronting you is that the city already has many entertainment centers that provide different kinds of entertainment activities for kids and adults at all price ranges. In addition, you have the resources to open any business. Your challenge is to decide which type of entertainment center is most likely to succeed as your first step in joining a new industry. What were the top three types of entertainment options developed by your group? Explain the benefits and drawbacks of each choice. What decision have you made regarding the type of entertainment center? Why?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
