    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Chapter 7 · Session 26</span>\n<h2>Session 26 — 7.2 Steps in organization change</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14193 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Chương 7 · Buổi 26</span>\n<h2>Buổi 26 — 7.2 Steps in organization change</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14193 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>7.2 Steps in organization change<br>Group Exercise Chap 7 (optional)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>9.2</strong> — You are the Southern sales managers of EuroWindow, which supplies high-quality windows nationwide. Over the last three years, the rate of sales growth has declined. There is increasing evidence that salespeople are primarily servicing large customer accounts and ignoring small accounts to make their jobs easier. In addition, the salespeople need to be dealing promptly with customer questions and complaints, and this inattention has resulted in a drop in after-sales service. You have discussed these issues and are meeting to discuss how to boost sales volume and customer service quality by making some changes in the Sales Department. What are the areas of organizational change in general? Based on the information provided in the case, what areas in EuroWindow do you propose to have changed?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
