    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Class Participation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14193 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Class Participation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14193 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">-</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: While this is a subjective measure, lecturer will try to standardize it as much as possible by tracking your participation in class discussions and activities. To earn the participation point, you must actively and productively engage in group discussion, exercises and homework. Reading in advance is the MUST. Also, arriving late to class causes a distraction and will hurt your participation grade.<br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
