    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Assessment 5/6</span>\n<h2>Quiz</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14193 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Đầu điểm 5/6</span>\n<h2>Quiz</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14193 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: 30 minutes eachOption 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Multiple choicesMarked by Computer or a suitable formatOption 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: 25 MC questions each quiz.Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Quizzes and exercises will test for knowledge of subjects in the chapters assigned for that day.Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: In class, by instructor.<br><br>These quizzes and exercises will be given at various times during class (beginning, middle or end-another good reason to arrive on time). Total number of quizzes: 3.<br><br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 19 — Quiz 1: Chapter 1,2,3,4</li><li>Session 40 — Quiz 2: Chapter 6,7,8,10</li><li>Session 54 — Quiz 3: Chapter 11,14,15</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 19 — Quiz 1: Chapter 1,2,3,4</li><li>Buổi 40 — Quiz 2: Chapter 6,7,8,10</li><li>Buổi 54 — Quiz 3: Chapter 11,14,15</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
